{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":172614,\"title\":\"Cash Claim Chaos\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Hospital orderly Rozruch, denied his therapeutic treatment, is mistaken for Dr. Marek at the insurance office and sent to a spa. Councilor Pěna, plotting to wed his mistress after his daughter Heda’s marriage, also arrives. At the spa, impostures collide, identities are exposed, and hidden motives and loyalties come to light.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qB4EqPWaeRnoCVi8Z08mzLhHCGO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qpGYuBY2lVHmbQqm0wL7KNIcwJI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":1939,\"runtime\":99,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"XC\",\"name\":\"Czechoslovakia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Karel Lamač\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":166894,\"name\":\"Karel Lamač\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nh1N49EtJ7H1jpPUmDOVpitOXUq.jpg\"},{\"id\":137014,\"name\":\"Vlasta Burian\",\"character\":\"Kryštof Rozruch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gYaBi6phaNcecZF37phx4s7bKTZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":44214,\"name\":\"Jaroslav Marvan\",\"character\":\"MUDr. Osvald Bruner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xkjJWL2SSkLfKR49IOdQArHYqb7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1337875,\"name\":\"Ladislav Hemmer\",\"character\":\"Secretary\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kJXwKfmmmXv1nsZwaTfaIu2IpXQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":143478,\"name\":\"Adina Mandlová\",\"character\":\"Vera\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/toKalpFXC1JI7r98YbR02dZI1cK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1336785,\"name\":\"Marie Blažková\",\"character\":\"Vera's Mother\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yAPWEKkDay8A7UtgtN6f1b6fwig.jpg\"},{\"id\":544287,\"name\":\"Čeněk Šlégl\",\"character\":\"Richard Pěna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wL42B0MOQq6ManwGChu7QxUvFN.jpg\"},{\"id\":1155223,\"name\":\"Anna Gabrielová\",\"character\":\"Heda Pěnová\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1155220,\"name\":\"Antonín Streit\",\"character\":\"primář MUDr. Leon Marek\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":544293,\"name\":\"Karel Postranecký\",\"character\":\"Doctor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":544289,\"name\":\"Václav Trégl\",\"character\":\"Klucek - Patient\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jgva5eCUHgL4JUSnQcRWQEGNTGv.jpg\"},{\"id\":1183352,\"name\":\"Emanuel Kovařík\",\"character\":\"Patočka\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1280129,\"name\":\"Antonín Soukup\",\"character\":\"Door-keeper\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1458916,\"name\":\"Marta Školudová\",\"character\":\"Nurse\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1458914,\"name\":\"Václav Mlčkovský\",\"character\":\"Spa Gate-keeper\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1337889,\"name\":\"Václav Menger\",\"character\":\"Vinárník\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1072790,\"title\":\"Anyone but You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5qHoazZiaLe7oFBok7XlUhg96f2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9eOeLlTGoHoM8BNUJVNyWmIvCi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After an amazing first date, Bea and Ben’s fiery attraction turns ice cold — until they find themselves unexpectedly reunited at a destination wedding in Australia. So they do what any two mature adults would do: pretend to be a couple.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11631,\"title\":\"Mamma Mia!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYLiCWmAMHJubx5jNZ7HuXKjAbV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/90sDsHugeRU5dtTG3zEVIOXXl4L.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A spirited young bride-to-be living with her single mother on a small Greek island secretly invites three of her mother's ex-boyfriends in hope of finding her biological father to walk her down the aisle.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":196867,\"title\":\"Annie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aKAM9V0izx4VhsdyAdBvAB26UCZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j3snmrxqxT60FrH1Z8i54fGnHZJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Annie is a young, happy foster kid who's also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they'd be back for her someday, it's been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything's about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he's her guardian angel, but Annie's self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it's the other way around.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":673593,\"title\":\"Mean Girls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbbj3viSUDEGT1fFFMNpHP1iUjw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/accTIUygtg24TM7wT7uQMMdvYUW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"New student Cady Heron is welcomed into the top of the social food chain by the elite group of popular girls called ‘The Plastics,’ ruled by the conniving queen bee Regina George and her minions Gretchen and Karen. However, when Cady makes the major misstep of falling for Regina’s ex-boyfriend Aaron Samuels, she finds herself prey in Regina’s crosshairs. As Cady sets to take down the group’s apex predator with the help of her outcast friends Janis and Damian, she must learn how to stay true to herself while navigating the most cutthroat jungle of all: high school.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1574,\"title\":\"Chicago\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ED8cWCXY9zkx77Sd0N5qMbsdDP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/euxYhuuJjChU755u2YHj0ZPjww3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1450527,\"title\":\"Forbidden Fruits\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nSlKzxvXWOeDC9qZiwkhGuTAKkq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jAOpZDgy4eMY6o6oGdUiXk4SqvE.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At a mall store, Apple leads a secret witch cult with coworkers Cherry and Fig. New hire Pumpkin questions their sisterhood, forcing them to confront inner darkness or meet violent ends.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40096,\"title\":\"A Dog's Will\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z9Au9XtK0ARzkKGsZCzMkmKgMPf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/alQqTpmEkxSLgajfEYTsTH6nAKB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lively João Grilo and the sly Chicó are poor guys living in the hinterland who cheat a bunch of people in a small town in Northeastern Brazil. When they die, they have to be judged by Christ, the Devil and the Virgin Mary before they are admitted to paradise.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":668482,\"title\":\"Roald Dahl's Matilda the Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ga8R3OiOMMgSvZ4cOj8x7prUNYZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jG52tsazn04F1fe8hPZfVv7ICKt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An extraordinary young girl discovers her superpower and summons the remarkable courage, against all odds, to help others change their stories, whilst also taking charge of her own destiny. Standing up for what's right, she's met with miraculous results.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":224141,\"title\":\"Into the Woods\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pf0TdnITu380Zp8DMQx0jcwDsAS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qF938YRj7RoYkjwOsXFDNYf907J.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2976,\"title\":\"Hairspray\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fgMka3HtFvI5OgW1eYdR9XpySxH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oO55Z71apssUy4Cf0obsK2kX3oK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pleasantly plump teenager Tracy Turnblad auditions to be on Baltimore's most popular dance show - The Corny Collins Show - and lands a prime spot. Through her newfound fame, she becomes determined to help her friends and end the racial segregation that has been a staple of the show.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":536869,\"title\":\"Cats\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCNch5FmzT2WaUcY44925owIZXY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rXSDDbT43pcTjppu1qTxs1cOwla.jpg\",\"rating\":4.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A tribe of cats called the Jellicles must decide yearly which one will ascend to the Heaviside Layer and come back to a new Jellicle life.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":72113,\"title\":\"Carnage\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Imx53XV3T02ADlMxYazYXVNysZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mntBeW6TRgm7GkYJwRDy3oJnKtn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two pairs of parents hold a cordial meeting after their sons are involved in a fight, though as their time together progresses, increasin